            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "$companion_id",
            unit: "$companion_id",
            x: 8,
            y: 32,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "ignore_companion_defeat",
            value: "yes",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            portrait: "portraits/deoran-mad.webp",
            text: _("Ethiliel! What’s going on here? What have you done?!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            text: _("Deoran — good, you’re here. And even better, I see you no longer shelter that snake Afalas! Does this mean you humans have reconsidered your decisions, and have finally freed Mebrin from his bonds?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("Mebrin is dead, Ethiliel. Afalas was right. I saw the lich Mal M’Brin with my own two eyes, heard his ravings with my own two ears! I watched him raise the dead up out of the ground!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            portrait: "portraits/ethiliel-mad.webp",
            text: _("Then where is his corpse, mayfly? Where is the evidence for the horrible things of which you accuse? I have known Mebrin my whole life — you, scarcely four months. Who shall I believe?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            text: _("No, I felt Mebrin’s elfin presence. I felt him reaching out to me, I felt him in pain! No elf would fall to undeath, much less our wisest teacher."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            portrait: "portraits/ethiliel-mad.webp",
            text: _("I don’t know why you won’t just admit what you’ve truly done with him — you fool humans’ stubbornness will be all of your undoing! Until you return Mebrin to us I have no choice but to cut you down!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("Ethiliel, listen to yourself! ...there’s no reasoning with her, is there?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Deoran",
            x: 9,
            y: 29,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 150,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_terrain",
            terrain: "Ke",
            cells: "9,29",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 150,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_terrain",
            terrain: "Ce",
            cells: "8,30",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 150,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_terrain",
            terrain: "Ce",
            cells: "8,29",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 150,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_terrain",
            terrain: "Ce",
            cells: "9,28",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 150,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_terrain",
            terrain: "Ce",
            cells: "10,29",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 150,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:capture_village",
            side: 1,
            cells: "6,29",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("Whether this rage is Ethiliel herself, Mebrin’s dark influence, or a mix of both, it’s clear that words alone are not going to change her mind."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("No, absolutely not. I’ve spent enough time with Ethiliel to understand her and her culture. If we kill an elf of this importance in offensive action, never again in our lifetimes will there be peace between Wesnoth and the Aethenwood. And she’s not evil, she just... really believes she’s doing the right thing."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("Instead we make for Westin. We will rendezvous with the town defenders and hold the walls — the self-righteous fury that drives Ethiliel can only burn for so long. Once the dust settles, the elves may finally be willing to talk."),
          },
        ],
      },
