          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_29",
            type: "Troll",
            side: 1,
            x: 9,
            y: 21,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_29",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            portrait: "portraits/deoran-mad.webp",
            text: _("Ethiliel! What’s going on here? What have you done?!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            text: _("Deoran — good, you’re finally here. I knew that under enough pressure, Westin would eventually cave and summon you back. Does this mean you have reconsidered your decisions, and have finally freed Mebrin from his bonds?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("No-one summoned me here, Ethiliel. Afalas was right. I saw the lich Mal M’Brin with my own two eyes, heard his ravings with my own two ears! I watched him raise the dead up out of the ground!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            portrait: "portraits/ethiliel-mad.webp",
            text: _("More lies, infuriating lies! Where is his corpse, mayfly? Where is the evidence for the horrible things of which you accuse? No elf would fall to undeath, much less our wisest teacher."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Deoran",
            x: 5,
            y: 9,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("No elf could fall to undeath? What is this, then? I show you the skull of a lich, unmistakably elven, and unmistakably undead!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("My men and I chased Mal M’Brin down into the depths of the earth, pushing ourselves nearly to exhaustion. When at last the lich was on the brink of defeat, with his last gasp of foul magic he collapsed his cave on us."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("Many perished, including Mebrin himself. But after days of hard labor by both man and troll, we dug ourselves free and set out for Westin, bringing the skull of our vanquished foe. You recognize its elven features, Ethiliel, do you not?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            text: _("The Mebrin I know is so gentle. So wise! It cannot be... can it?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("You believe, but you do not want to believe. Please, Ethiliel — enough blood has been shed today."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            text: _("Mebrin... oh Mebrin... a lich!? But if Mebrin really did turn to undeath, then I have been the cause of so much meaningless bloodshed."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            text: _("It’s true, isn’t it..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            text: _("..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 250,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Ethiliel",
            x: 2,
            y: 9,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 250,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Ethiliel",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "sw",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            text: _("Deoran, thank you. I see now that not all humans are alike, and that you, too, are capable of courage and loyalty."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            text: _("Vengeance only begets more vengeance. Our attack against Westin is over."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "epilogue",
            value: "elves",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
    ],
